 "release": 0.5,
 "sustained": false,
 "notes": "Yamaha C5, AB stereo pair. 30 notes A0-C8 sampled every minor third, Salamander layer v12 (medium-loud), loudness-matched across the range. (The soft v6 layer was dropped: the suite always plays at velocity 88-96, so it was never heard.) Per-note tuning corrections from the Retuned SFZ shipped with V3 were applied. Natural decay, trimmed to 6 s (bass) .. 2 s (top octave) with a fade; for longer held notes let the release envelope take over. Same samples work for bright_acoustic_piano with a high-shelf boost. Recommended release 0.4-0.6 s (dampers).",
 "sampleRate": 44100
}
